flowchart LR
    accTitle: Web Scraper collection flow
    accDescr: An explicit collection request dispatches a source adapter, validates records, saves a MongoDB snapshot and makes saved results and history available after reload.
    Request[Explicit collection request] --> Collect[Source adapter]
    Collect --> Validate[Parse and validate]
    Validate --> Save[(MongoDB snapshot)]
    Save --> View[Saved results and history]
    View --> Reload[Reopen after reload]
